# README style

- Start with the project name, available badges, and one sentence that states what the tool does.
- Cover features, OS and architecture requirements, scope, quick start, reproducible build and test steps, support, licensing, and sources where relevant.
- Test command examples against the current CLI. Pair preview with apply and use full VHDX paths for boot registration.
- Distinguish verified Windows behavior from anything that still requires a reboot or an elevated integration test.
- Put project-wide guidance in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
